  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot prj DemoEnvironment - DemoEnvironment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pilot prj DemoEnvironment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xe5;llbar stadsutveckling och f&#xf6;rnyelsebar energi. DemoMilj&#xf6; kan underl&#xe4;tta aff&#xe4;rer f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;teknikf&#xf6;retag, oavsett om f&#xf6;retaget redan har en k&#xf6;pare eller inte. Bidraget g&#xe4;ller f&#xf6;r teknik som kan bidra till h&#xe5;llbar stadsutveckling, till exempel avfallshantering och f&#xf6;rnyelsebar energi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable urban development and renewable energy. Demo Environment can facilitate business for environmental technology companies, regardless of whether the company already has a buyer or not. The contribution can be applicable to technologies that contribute to sustainable urban development, such as waste management and renewable energy.</narrative>
  </description>
